WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.010
Your French friend says
her new «veste» is blue.

2
00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:05.530
You picture a vest.

3
00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:06.710
Are you sure?

4
00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:09.170
Then you read about «une tempête».

5
00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:10.470
Never seen it.

6
00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:12.120
Is there a clue anywhere?

7
00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.940
And «le parapluie».

8
00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:17.710
Long, strange, and nobody around to ask.

9
00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.970
So how can you work out a French word

10
00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.890
you've never seen before?

11
00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:26.460
In this mission, you'll spin a decoder
ring that cracks words in disguise.

12
00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:29.530
Then you'll turn detective,
with a magnifying glass,

13
00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:30.930
at a market stall.

14
00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:34.190
Your mission: work out words
you've never met before.
